{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415703","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415703","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1041570301:1":{"text":"구구! 저와 이렇게나 닮은 분이시라니!","source_cn":"咕唔！汝竟与吾如此相像！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4E65EF7010D61BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041570302:1":{"text":"이방인, 그대는 어디서 오셨습니까? 그대의 동족들도 모두 이렇게 생겼습니까?","source_cn":"外乡人，汝来自何方？汝之同胞是否都如你这般相貌？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x831B731CEC92A123","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041570303:1":{"text":"닮아? 어디가 닮았다는 건지 전혀 모르겠군.","source_cn":"相似？我看不出任何相似点。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x45824ACC7F85D391","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041570304:1":{"text":"내 고향은 이미 멸망했다. 지금의 나는 예언의 신전의 일원일 뿐이지.","source_cn":"我的家园早已倾覆。现在，我属于巫毒神庙。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4B49E13CCBBFC3A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041570305:1":{"text":"내 부족은 고향과 자유를 지키기 위한 전쟁에서 목숨을 잃었다. 모두 용감한 전사들이었지.","source_cn":"至于我的族人，他们都死在了保卫家园与自由的战争里。他们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCD2E277AFF66FFBD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041570306:1":{"text":"...그대의 슬픔이 느껴지는군요. 명복을 빕니다!","source_cn":"……吾能听出汝之伤痛。请节哀！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x799755A4A9C2E3A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041570307:1":{"text":"난 이미 참는 법을 배웠다.","source_cn":"我早已学会忍耐。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4A3B42C68280657","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041570308:1":{"text":"참으시다니! 그럴 필요가 있습니까?","source_cn":"忍耐！何需如此？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE605211EEEB81F2C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041570309:1":{"text":"살다보면 많은 것을 마음에 담게 되는 것이 있는 법이지요. 그러니, 스트레스를 푸는 것은 당연한 일입니다.","source_cn":"吾等生存于世，难免心中郁结，宣泄压力为人之常情。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x033075706CED2484","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041570310:1":{"text":"저처럼 밖에 나가서 질주하며 자연과 바람을 느껴보십시오.","source_cn":"汝可以像吾一般，外出奔跑，感受风与自然。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC302BD97339BBD5F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041570311:1":{"text":"하, 나도 가끔 그렇게 한다.","source_cn":"呵，我的确会这样做。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE2881B5E298BEE14","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041570312:1":{"text":"날아가는 화살을 쫓고, 지는 해를 쫓고, 자유도 좇고... 그럼 기분이 좋아지지.","source_cn":"追逐飞射的箭矢，追逐落日，追逐自由，都会让人心情愉悦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B8175837CED4B87","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041570313:1":{"text":"바로 그것입니다! 질주 후의 고요함을 느끼며, 털을 정돈하는 것 또한 색다른 즐거움이지요.","source_cn":"正是如此！趁着奔跑后的平静时刻梳理毛发，亦是一种别样享受。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCAB541C1D708CE2E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041570314:1":{"text":"...우리 둘, 통하는 게 꽤 있군.","source_cn":"……看来你我之间，确实有不少共同语言。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9F6D6B43D4D6A428","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1041570315:1":{"text":"이방인 전사여. 나 잔드록, 너와 맹약을 맺겠다. 사명이 끝나면 나와 속도로 승부를 벌이자!","source_cn":"外族的战士，赞东与你立约，待职责卸去，与我来一场速度的较量！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x84AED4733B348655","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1041570316:1":{"text":"질주 하나만큼은 단 한 번도 패배해 본 적 없다.","source_cn":"在奔跑一事上，我还从未尝败绩。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70497952E9D3D1A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1041570317:1":{"text":"구구! 바라던 바입니다!","source_cn":"咕唔！吾正有此意！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x29ADD534F58F47DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:卡夫拉":{"text":"카프라","source":"卡夫拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:赞东":{"text":"잔드록","source":"赞东","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":18,"localized_text_count":17,"speaker_count":2}}